## Meeting

@mara: The lantern festival is coming. We need hands.
<branch id="help" prompt="Will you help?">
  <choice id="yes" label="Count me in">
    ::set{user.bond.mara += 1}
    ::assert{canSail(gull)}
    @mara: Good. Take the Gull out tomorrow.
  </choice>
  <choice id="no" label="Maybe later">
    @mara: Suit yourself.
  </choice>
</branch>
